; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
; The kingdom's commander, a young woman: the first person in the game who talks.
;
; A person rather than a fighter. She stands on the engine's neutral side, which
; no hero and no monster is the enemy of; she has no Body, so nothing targets her
; and she never dies; and her Weight is 0, so no floor ever draws her. What she
; says is her Npc block in data/story/story.duke; where she stands is a map's Npcs.
;
; Her look is a stand-in until her own model is made: the KayKit ranger, which no
; hero wears any more (the rogue has his own mesh).
; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Monster
  Name = Commander
  DisplayName = Qo'mondon Laylo
  KindOf = [INFANTRY, SELECTABLE]
  Geometry = Cylinder
    Radius = 4
    Height = 12
  End
  VisionRange = 0
  MinDepth = 99
  Weight = 0
  Colour = 0xE8C15A
  Scale = 1.0
  Model = models/heroes/ranger.glb
  ; The kit's people box about 2.18 tall: 12 / 2.18, as the rogue's.
  ModelScale = 5.5
  Facing = 90
  Animations = Humanoid
End
